<h2 id="section8">8. Continuous Integration with GitHub Actions</h2>
<p>
I created an automated CI workflow in <code>.github/workflows/ci.yml</code> that runs on every push and pull request to <code>main</code>:
</p>
<ul>
    <li><strong>Environment:</strong> Ubuntu Linux with Eclipse Temurin JDK 21 / 17.</li>
    <li><strong>Pipeline Steps:</strong>
        <ol>
            <li>Checks out the code.</li>
            <li>Sets up the JDK and caches Maven dependencies.</li>
            <li>Executes <code>xvfb-run mvn clean verify</code> (running unit tests, integration tests with Testcontainers, and AssertJ-Swing GUI tests).</li>
            <li>Transmits code coverage to <strong>Coveralls</strong>.</li>
            <li>Runs <strong>SonarCloud</strong> analysis with the required tokens.</li>
        </ol>
    </li>
</ul>

